#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:5 1e41b99de47c415eb8ca228aa6699160
msgid "APJ Tools for Custom Parameter Defaults"
msgstr "用于自定义参数默认值的 APJ 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:7 d46376d1df68421cb2dcf89a46a4e740
msgid ""
"this capability has been removed as of ArduPilot version 4.5 and later. "
"See instead :ref:`common-oem-customizations`."
msgstr "此功能自 ArduPilot 4.5 版本起已移除。请改参阅 :ref:`common-oem-customizations`。"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:9 12c04276f82b4fa0adb8d4b1c1ce3a22
msgid ""
"`APJ Tools "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__"
" is a command-line `Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ program"
" which can be used to add custom default parameter values to a pre-built "
"ArduPilot firmware.  It can also mark these parameters as read-only to "
"avoid users accidentally overwriting them.  This can help companies "
"reduce the time required to set up many identical vehicles."
msgstr ""
"`APJ 工具 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__"
" 是一个命令行 `Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ 程序，可用于向预构建的 "
"ArduPilot 固件添加自定义默认参数值。它还可以将这些参数标记为只读，以防止用户意外覆盖。这有助于公司减少配置多台相同飞行器所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:11 bdb62c07a5b245aebab428211dca3ecb
msgid ""
"Additional customization options are possible by creating a new build "
"target for a specific vehicle. :ref:`OEM Customization<common-oem-"
"customizations>`"
msgstr "通过为特定飞行器创建新的构建目标，可以实现更多自定义选项。:ref:`OEM 定制<common-oem-customizations>`"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:14 7c3668e0857d4aab90e7a3121ca7cf8f
msgid "How to Install APJ Tools"
msgstr "如何安装 APJ Tools"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:16 14990ed7d8c34356bee86808191ee54b
msgid ""
"`Download and Install Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ if "
"not already installed on your machine"
msgstr "如果尚未安装，请 `下载并安装 Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:17 97f04179816d477394f481c5d8514f9e
msgid ""
"Use a web browser to open `APJ Tools "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__"
" in the ArduPilot GitHub repository and then right-mouse-button click and"
" save to a file on your PC"
msgstr ""
"使用浏览器打开 ArduPilot GitHub 仓库中的 `APJ Tools "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__，然后鼠标右键单击并保存到计算机上的文件"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:20 8d4a3066c72040f8b78fa6a8be41388e
msgid "How to update the Defaults"
msgstr "如何更新默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:22 94e5fa432d604f8f85b5e60c84892c1e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Find and download the ArduPilot firmware you wish to customize from "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__.  For "
"example, the stable version of ArduPilot Copter for the CubePilot Cube "
"Black is the \"arducopter.apj\" file found at "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack/ "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack>`__."
msgstr ""
"从 `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ 查找并下载您要定制的"
" ArduPilot 固件。例如，适用于 Hex Cube Black 的 ArduPilot Copter 稳定版是位于 "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack/ "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack>`__ 的 "
"「arducopter.apj」 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:23 814c96c7bbc0497ba1eb0285dc784613
msgid "Place the above .apj file in the same directory as the apj_tool.py file"
msgstr "将上述 .apj 文件放置于与 apj_tool.py 文件相同的目录中"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:24 8900037c148842b5a8f08891f2ab2123
msgid ""
"Use a text editor to create a parameters file (maybe called \"param-"
"defaults.parm\") of this format"
msgstr "使用文本编辑器创建此格式的参数文件（可命名为 「param-defaults.parm」）"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:32 6a9462e4197e4a8f84d68606a71bc39f
msgid "Embed the parameter defaults in the .apj firmware with this command"
msgstr "使用此命令将参数默认值嵌入 .apj 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:38 7997e8187eed4897a5c97784b7111d50
msgid "Check the defaults have been applied correctly with this command"
msgstr "使用此命令验证默认值是否已正确应用"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:44 51ad5f5e4e144425abca89ae80ebc9d7
msgid ""
"Load the modified .apj file to your vehicle and check the defaults have "
"worked correctly"
msgstr "将修改后的 .apj 文件加载到飞行器，并验证默认值是否正常生效"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:47 2d2bdc80efe042a8ab7ed167eb315074
msgid "Additional Info"
msgstr "附加信息"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:49 96562a8374cd4be2bb8f0a69272a0d22
msgid "APJ Tool's help can be displayed using this command"
msgstr "可使用此命令显示 APJ Tool 的帮助信息"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:55 9748c245958c4901ac40f0c6951e82b0
msgid ""
"The parameters will be the new default values only if the user has not "
"modified them"
msgstr "仅当用户未修改参数时，这些参数才会采用新的默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:56 6a7f0d5c572545f2bb51e6cd132ca2dc
msgid ""
"If all parameters are reset to their defaults, they will return to the "
"values specified in the file"
msgstr "如果将所有参数重置为默认值，它们将恢复为文件中指定的值"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:57 b9dd6f106ee94b92a625a61504b5aa73
msgid ""
"The @READONLY modifier will stop users from modifying the parameter as "
"long as they use this particular firmware.  The users can get around this"
" though if they go to the extra effort of loading the standard ArduPilot "
"firmware to the autopilot"
msgstr "@READONLY 修饰符将阻止用户修改参数，只要他们使用该特定固件。但用户可以通过额外操作将标准 ArduPilot 固件加载到飞控来绕过此限制"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:58 524d2fa2ba1f4be7b3de67981b22ce67
msgid "The new parameter default file can be a maximum of 8k including comments"
msgstr "新参数默认值文件（含注释）最大不超过 8k"

